      "content": "[https://www.freelists.org/archive/math4wisdom/](https://www.freelists.org/archive/math4wisdom/)\n\n\n\n---\n\nEvery six months or so, I like to write about the state of Math 4 Wisdom, reflecting on where we are and where I want to go, pursuing research, fostering our culture, growing our community.  Here are two previous overviews:  \nAugust 23, 2023 [https://www.freelists.org/post/math4wisdom/Plans-for-Math-4-Wisdom](https://www.freelists.org/post/math4wisdom/Plans-for-Math-4-Wisdom)  \n\nNovember 25, 2022 [https://www.freelists.org/post/math4wisdom/The-State-of-Math-4-Wisdom](https://www.freelists.org/post/math4wisdom/The-State-of-Math-4-Wisdom)\n\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\n\nMore contemplative email list. \n\nSocial in a longer term way. \n\nDifferent pillars and values.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
